 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 7 more propeller codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 6 more propeller codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 5 more propeller codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 4 more propeller codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 3 more propeller codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 2 more propeller codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 1 more propeller code left.": "",
  "(...And that's the last of the propeller codes.\nBetter report back to Hutton.)": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 9 more ESC codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 8 more ESC codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 7 more ESC codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 6 more ESC codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 5 more ESC codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 4 more ESC codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 3 more ESC codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 2 more ESC codes left.": "",
  "All right, I got the photo. Only 1 more ESC code left.": "",
  "(...And that's the last of the ESC codes.\nBetter report back to Hutton.)": "",
  "E-Excuse me, but may I have a moment of your time!?": "",
  "Uh, sure?": "",
  "Okay! I'm, uh, Takeo Inose, the manager of the Wild Jackson in which you have just eaten!": "",
  "Look, I'm in a terrible bind here... If you would be so kind as to share your thoughts on how to improve our restaurant...": "",
  "I would be forever in your debt!": "",
  "(This guy looks like he's about to have a meltdown. Maybe talking to him will help calm him down.)": "",
  "I guess I could share a few thoughts.": "",
  "Oh, you're a godsend! So, what advice can you give me?": "",
  "You're looking to make it better? I mean, I already enjoy the food. Are you not making enough profit or something?": "",
  "Yes, lately we've been hit hard by our rival, Wette Kitchen. Our profits have been tanking.": "",
  "And with sales as low as these, corporate's been dangling the idea of termination over my head unless I turn things around...": "",
  "Ouch. I had no idea things were that bad.": "",
  "...I guess you didn't need to hear all that. Sorry to trouble you.": "",
  "Well, now I understand why you're worried.": "",
  "Anyway. Is there anything in particular you wanted feedback on?": "",
  "Ah, yes! I was hoping to present some potential improvements to our store, and possibly the rest of the chain.": "",
  "Tell me, is there anything about Wild Jackson that strikes you as mediocre, or perhaps even unappealing?": "",
  "Hmm... It's pretty tough to say. I can't really think of anything specific.": "",
  "Maybe you should ask a customer who hasn't been here in a while? Or someone who doesn't eat here anymore period?": "",
  "That would be ideal...": "",
  "But how would I even begin looking for someone like that?": "",
  "(Come to think of it, I do remember seeing something about Wild Jackson while scrolling through Chatter a while back.)": "",
  "(I imagine if there were any complaints online, they'd be on social media. Maybe we can use those as clues to turn this place around.)": "",
  "(Besides, I already have a lead, so I may as well lend a hand. Seems like this guy's got it pretty rough as it is.)": "",
  "I have an idea, Inose-san. One of my friends is really good at finding things on social media. Why don't we start there?": "",
  "Huh!? You're... really gonna help me out?": "",
  "Yeah. If there's any information that needs finding, we're your go-to guys.": "",
  "Thank you... kind sir!": "",
  "(Tsukumo should be at Mantai as usual. I'll have him check out Wild Jackson's reputation.)": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san, it's you!": "",
  "How's business these days, Inose-san?": "",
  "Not bad, but it could be better. I'm having trouble thinking up new ideas for our upcoming special.": "",
  "It pains me to admit it, but there's not a lot you can do with a chicken patty. Wette Kitchen, on the other hand...": "",
  "Ah, that's right. Wette Kitchen gives you pretty stiff competition, don't they?": "",
  "Yes, particularly the one on West Taihei Boulevard. They've been our main competitor for many years.": "",
  "Looks like you guys are screwed.": "",
  "Unfortunately, it does...": "",
  "You mean... he wants to cooperate with another fast food chain!? The absolute madman!": "",
  "Ah, if it isn't Yagami-san, the sandwich shop sleuth!": "",
  "Good to see you, Inose-san. You too, Furuya-san.": "",
  "Thank you again for all your help. Come to think of it, this is the first time all three of us have met together.": "",
  "It is, isn't it. So how's that collaboration coming along?": "",
  "Well, thanks to you and Furuya-san, Wette Kitchen agreed to be our partner for this project.": "",
  "And even though our campaign just started today, it's already bringing in the big bucks!": "",
  "That's great to hear.": "",
  "On top of that, thanks to the increase in profits, my bosses decided they won't be closing down the store!": "",
  "Now I won't have any more nightmares about getting fired... Or getting my face dunked in the deep fryer.": "",
  "I'm glad you can finally work without buckling under all that pressure. Good for you.": "",
  "I owe it all to your valiant efforts, Yagami-san. I don't know how I can possibly repay you.": "",
  "Ah, don't mention it. I was just doing my thing.": "",
  "Well, just know your contribution was vital to our success, Yagami-san. We really couldn't have done it without you.": "",
  "And you're good too, Furuya-san?": "",
  "Oh yes! Thank you so much for your thoughtful advice, and for including me in such a well thought-out campaign.": "",
  "All of us at Wette Kitchen appreciate your help. Both restaurants benefit so much by working together.": "",
  "Take, for instance, the fact that our company had previously put an emphasis on sales alone...": "",
  "But by learning from a similar chain like Wild Jackson, we were able to gain more insight into our overall outlook.": "",
  "We want to follow Wild Jackson's example of being loyal to their main product, namely, their fantastic fried chicken.": "",
  "Pretty soon, our negotiation became an open discussion about developing our strengths and reaching our full potential.": "",
  "After listening to Furuya-san's thoughts, we started to tackle tough problems... and solve them the Wette Kitchen way.": "",
  "Both of our companies are very grateful to you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Ah, all I did was put two and two together, and look what happened. Restaurant history in the making.": "",
  "Ahaha, perhaps you're right. Oh, I almost forgot! Late as it is, I hope you'll still accept a token of our gratitude.": "",
  "We hope it truly expresses the combined appreciation of both of our establishments. I guess that's a thank-you combo!": "",
  "Though we may be separate companies, our goals are one and the same: to serve the best fast food in Tokyo!": "",
  "Couldn't have said it better myself, Inose-san.": "",
  "Any time you want to try the new special, just come to either store and we'll start your order right away!": "",
  "What do you need, Yagami-shi?": "",
  "I'm helping out this guy who needs some research. Can you do your thing?": "",
  "You mean the Chatter search? Sure. What do you want to look up?": "",
  "I need to figure out what people have been saying about Wild Jackson recently. Limit the posts to within this past month.": "",
  "No prob, I'll push it to your phone.": "",
  "Hmm. This is a lot of hits. Anything we can use to narrow this down?": "",
  "Yeah, I need to find out why Wild Jackson's sales have been going down.": "",
  "I should choose more specific keywords... Something logical that would bring up the most relevant posts. Let's see here.": "",
  "Can you put... \"chicken\" as a keyword?": "",
  "Seems positive enough. Wild Jackson's fried chicken is a classic.": "",
  "Mmm... I suppose we won't get any further by looking up what they're doing right.": "",
  "Can you put... \"scandal\" as a keyword?": "",
  "Hmm. Fewer hits than I would have thought. Nothing substantial, either.": "",
  "Can you try... \"tastes like ass\"? That's what I'd post if I hated it.": "",
  "Hmm, nothing pops out. And that's including posts with derivative keywords like \"tastes,\" \"ass,\" and \"ass-like taste.\"": "",
  "I guess if people didn't like the food, this place would already be long gone. I know everything tastes fine to me.": "",
  "Still... This isn't adding up. Let's switch it up.": "",
  "Can you put... \"specials\" as a keyword?": "",
  "Here we go. Most of these posts do seem to be asking about new specials. Perhaps they haven't done any promotions lately.": "",
  "Gotcha. If people get bored of the same old menu, they might stop coming as often. Which would naturally impact Wild Jackson's revenue.": "",
  "Sounds like you hit the nail on the head.": "",
  "Then I guess it's case closed. Thanks, Tsukumo, I got what I needed.": "",
  "Glad to be of service. Feel free to ask for my assistance whenever you need it.": "",
  "So... What did you find out?": "",
  "Let me ask you something. When was the last time Wild Jackson came out with any new promotions?": "",
  "Huh!? Hmm... Actually, now that you mention it, it has been quite a long time.": "",
  "Well, it seems like people are wondering what's the next big thing for Wild Jackson. They're hungry for something new.": "",
  "That... actually makes a lot of sense! We've definitely been slacking in the creative department lately. At least I have.": "",
  "F-Forget I said that! Anyways, I'm gonna gather more info that supports your findings and report to corporate at once!": "",
  "Yeah, that's probably a good idea.": "",
  "Oh, by the way. I want to thank you properly for all your help. May I have your name?": "",
  "I'm Takayuki Yagami. As for thanking me... all I really want is to try your new special.": "",
  "Once it's ready, sure! Until then, I'll get busy making Wild Jackson the best it can possibly be!": "",
  "Sorry, but I'm a little busy right now.": "",
  "Understood. I apologize for taking up your time...": "",
  "Oh! You're a regular customer of ours, correct?": "",
  "Please... If you have a spare moment, would you be willing to share your thoughts on how we could improve!?": "",
  "(That's the manager who was having a meltdown. Should I hear him out?)": "",
  "Tsukumo, do you have a sec?": "",
  "(This conversation is getting us nowhere...)": "",
  "In that case... I know something that might interest you.": "",
  "The marketing supervisor for Wette Kitchen's was actually looking to do a collaboration.": "",
  "Well, he was organizing a new promotional campaign and his idea got selected, so maybe he's not so mad after all.": "",
  "However, he went all in on the promotion thinking he could find a partner on the fly.": "",
  "And if you're having trouble coming up with ideas, then this might be a good fit for you. Maybe you two will end up making something big.": "",
  "Inose-san?": "",
  "...You know, I could see this working! Yes! What a novel idea! Wette Kitchen really knows their stuff!": "",
  "(Well, I was the one who thought of it.)": "",
  "I have a feeling this is gonna be a winner! I'll go ask permission from corporate and contact Wette Kitchen right away!": "",
  "Then be sure to ask for Furuya. He's the guy in charge over there.": "",
  "Furuya, got it! Thanks so much!": "",
  "Yagami-san, you said you're going to investigate our reputation on social media? Thanks for all the trouble.": "",
  "Pardon the interruption, but may I have a moment of your time?": "",
  "Great. My name is Yasuhiro Furuya, and I'm the event planner for Wette Kitchen, a local burger shop.": "",
  "I'd like to get more acquainted with our customer base and see how they perceive our restaurant.": "",
  "Is that so... Then I apologize for taking up your time.": "",
  "(So he wants to interview me about the restaurant... Should I go through with it?)": "",
  "Oh, hello again, sir. Glad to see you're back! Do you have a moment to share your thoughts?": "",
  "Well, you see, our corporate office is asking us to come up with a new collaboration campaign for each of our stores.": "",
  "But, to put it to you plainly... I'm terrible at thinking up new ideas.": "",
  "That's why I decided to take a chance and leave it up to our customers.": "",
  "If your suggestion does get used, I'll make sure to give you some form of compensation as well!": "",
  "But I've rambled on enough, haven't I? Please, let us know what kind of store you'd like to see us cooperate with.": "",
  "(What should I do?)": "",
  "I can chat for a bit.": "",
  "I'm not entirely sure partnering with a café would leave a noticeable impression. Perhaps I'll save that for reference.": "",
  "So... what did you want to ask me about?": "",
  "(That is a bold move...)": "",
  "(Hmm. Getting the chance to influence a local fast food chain is pretty rare... But what would mesh well with Wette Kitchen?)": "",
  "A cabaret club!? Well... yes, it would turn heads, but in the wrong direction. That's far too adult-oriented for us.": "",
  "A café. They're practically all over Kamurocho.": "",
  "(He doesn't seem too impressed. Maybe I should go for something else.)": "",
  "That's... a possibility. Though wouldn't that essentially be pushing for more of the same thing?": "",
  "Okay, let's try something else then.": "",
  "But... is such a thing even possible? It's practically unheard of in the industry.": "",
  "That being said...": "",
  "Perhaps it's all the more worth it to try.": "",
  "How about a cabaret club? It would definitely turn a lot of heads, if that's what you're going for.": "",
  "In that case, I'll propose this campaign to corporate right away!": "",
  "I would like to give you a little something in case your idea is used. May I have your name?": "",
  "Now that you mention it, children do come here pretty often. My mistake. I'll think of something else.": "",
  "You bet I will. If and when I hear the good news, I'll contact you right away!": "",
  "Why not another fast food place?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san! You're right on time!": "",
  "And you're... Furuya-san from Wette Kitchen, right?": "",
  "Yes! I wanted to thank you for your participation earlier.": "",
  "So I submitted your idea to corporate and they were so impressed, they greenlit it right away!": "",
  "Wow, they're really going through with it?": "",
  "Yes. Except for one problem. They can't decide on which store to work with.": "",
  "After all, we're basically asking our rivals to cooperate with us. Not many stores are open to that idea.": "",
  "Yeah... I can't imagine it'd be easy.": "",
  "(Maybe I should be on the lookout for the kind of restaurant he needs. That should help him out plenty.)": "",
  "Hmm... What to do...": "",
  "Well, don't you think it'd be awesome if two rival restaurants ended up working together?": "",
  "I'm Takayuki Yagami. Let me know what happens, yeah?": "",
  "(It really would be cool to see what two fast food giants could come up with. Hope it turns out well.)": "",
  "Furuya-san, did you find a good place to collaborate with?": "",
  "I'm afraid not. It's difficult when it comes to finding good fast food.": "",
  "(If I run across a potential business partner for him, I should give him a heads-up.)": "",
  "(Translator? What's she talking about?)": "",
  "[Pardon me, but do you happen to know where the lavatory is?]": "",
  "(Hmm, I've always been good at basic English. I should take over from here.)": "",
  "Hey, all he wants to know is where the restroom is.": "",
  "[It's right outside the café. You can't miss it.]": "",
  "[Excellent, thank you very much.]": "",
  "(That went pretty well. Hope I wasn't too rusty.)": "",
  "Well, at least you know your basics. Sometimes it's hard to determine the best word to say.": "",
  "Gotcha. So you're a student right now?": "",
  "Not a bad idea. Well, keep it up and maybe your English will improve.": "",
  "Likewise. Well, keep at it.": "",
  "No problem, what's up?": "",
  "Wait, they were holding <font_kind=yakuza_italic>cabbage</font_kind>? And you asked if you could hold it for them?": "",
  "Hmm... Now what would a hotel employee ask to hold for their guest...?": "",
  "Oh, wait. Never mind. I meant to say...": "",
  "You probably mixed up \"baggage\" and \"cabbage.\" But I think it's also called \"luggage\"?": "",
  "I suppose it's less confusing in English, since anything you carry around can technically be considered baggage. Even pain.": "",
  "Nah, you're fine. Hit me with your question.": "",
  "I think they wanted to take you out for dinner. Foreigners can be very aggressive at flirting.": "",
  "Ah, well, actually... I was just messing around.": "",
  "I think they wanted to \"take you out.\" As in, eliminate you.": "",
  "Sorry. I've had a lot going on...": "",
  "It's another way of saying \"take it to go.\"": "",
  "Well, now you know something new. I'm sure you won't make the same mistake twice.": "",
  "I try.": "",
  "Am I imagining this? Or did you get really fluent in English?": "",
  "Wow. Looks like all your practice has finally paid off.": "",
  "Whoa! That was quick!　": "",
  "Well, they do say the quickest way to learn a language is to find yourself a lover.": "",
  "You'll get there sooner than you think. I'll be rooting for you.": "",
  "You sure that won't be too much of a hassle?": "",
  "Um... Uh... Ahhh! Help! Someone bring a translator!": "",
  "No, it isn't! I don't understand a word this guy's saying... Please, help a girl out!": "",
  "Oh! I-It's right outside the café! Umm... In English that would be...": "",
  "I'm sorry about that, sir. That other word really caught me off guard.": "",
  "I always thought it was just \"toilet\" in English.": "",
  "Yeah... I do like the language, but I haven't been studying for long.": "",
  "Yeah, I'm actually in college. I've been thinking of working overseas for a while, too. Once I graduate, anyway.": "",
  "So I decided to start working here to get some more speaking practice.": "",
  "You know, since hotels generally have a lot of foreign customers.": "",
  "Yes! Thank you for today's lesson!": "",
  "Oh, and can I ask your name?": "",
  "And I'm Kaede Sanada. It was really nice to meet you!": "",
  "I will! Hope to see you next time!": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san! Sorry, but can I ask you something?": "",
  "I just asked a customer, \"Would you like me to hold your cabbage?\" in English... But they didn't understand at all.": "",
  "See, I knew cabbage wasn't the right word...": "",
  "I know I've heard this word somewhere before... It's right at the tip of my tongue...": "",
  "Huh? Why on earth would somebody be carrying crab legs? That's not even close.": "",
  "Huh? That's just something you give away as a prize. That wasn't it.": "",
  "Wow, I had no idea... That's still... incredibly confusing! But thanks!": "",
  "Wow, Yagami-san, you sure know your stuff! I learned a lot today.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san! I have another question!": "",
  "You're probably wondering what kind of English I've been studying in the first place...": "",
  "'Kay. There was this customer who ordered something for \"takeout.\" What's that supposed to mean?": "",
  "Huh...? So they wanted to take me on a date!?": "",
  "That's not even funny, Yagami-san. Please be serious.": "",
  "Oh! So that's why they were looking at me all weird...": "",
  "I brought their order out as usual without packing anything up. Now I feel kinda bad...": "",
  "Hehe, you've got such a good perspective on things.": "",
  "[Hi, Yagami!]": "",
  "Nope, it's all real! I'm glad it's not just me who thinks so.": "",
  "I'm sure that's part of it. But, actually...": "",
  "Would you believe it if I told you I got a non-Japanese boyfriend?": "",
  "Hehe. He was staying at the hotel when we first met. When I tried to speak to him in English, he replied in Japanese.": "",
  "And it's been smooth sailing ever since! We're basically studying each other's language, so we help each other learn.": "",
  "Maybe so! Though, I still can't say with confidence that I'm a true English speaker just yet...": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "(What should I do?)": "(ควรทำยังไงดีนะ?)",
  "Hmm... What to do...": "อืม... จะทำยังไงดี...",
  "I try.": "พยายามอยู่"
 }
}
